\f2\i We can\'92t go on as Elvi with religious minds
\f1\i0 , and 
\f2\i Praise the Dawkins he\'92s the one
\f1\i0 . An enthusiastic contest broke out among factions singing preferred lines until all the mobs found themselves singing as one:\
